<title>SWEDEN: Skanska to build business centre in Riga.</title>
<headline>Skanska to build business centre in Riga.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction group Skanska AB said on Friday it will build the first modern office and business centre in Riga, Latvia.</p>
<p>Skanska and the City of Riga will invest $19 million in the project, which they will develop jointly, Skanska said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Valdemara Centre is expected to be completed in the autumn of 1998.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
